WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:14.760
"Help!" Ribby cried.

2
00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:21.622
She bobbed up and down in the water.

3
00:00:21.623 --> 00:00:25.444
"I'm coming!" Jeremy cried.

4
00:00:25.445 --> 00:00:35.530
"Swim, Ribby!"

5
00:00:35.531 --> 00:00:41.622
He jumped into his boat.

6
00:00:41.623 --> 00:00:45.271
Ribby's dress tangled around her legs.

7
00:00:45.272 --> 00:00:48.904
"I'm trying to swim!" she cried.

8
00:00:48.905 --> 00:00:52.350
"But my dress is too long!"

9
00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:55.976
Ribby splashed.

10
00:00:55.977 --> 00:01:05.337
She gulped water.

11
00:01:05.338 --> 00:01:09.436
Jeremy paddled as fast as he could.

12
00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:12.178
At last he reached Ribby.

13
00:01:12.179 --> 00:01:14.897
"Here," Jeremy said.

14
00:01:14.898 --> 00:01:20.490
"Grab my hand!"

15
00:01:20.491 --> 00:01:25.843
Jeremy pulled Ribby into the boat.

16
00:01:25.859 --> 00:01:28.799
Ribby coughed.

17
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.805
She spit out water.

18
00:01:33.806 --> 00:01:39.017
"Thank you!" she said. "You saved me!"

19
00:01:39.018 --> 00:01:42.026
Jeremy sighed.

20
00:01:42.027 --> 00:01:45.191
"I will never bring you flowers again."

21
00:01:45.192 --> 00:01:50.059
Ribby smiled. "Good idea!"

22
00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.482
Jeremy thought for a second.

23
00:01:53.483 --> 00:01:57.421
"Do you like green fly sandwiches?"

24
00:01:57.422 --> 00:01:59.979
"Yes," Ribby said.

25
00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:03.197
"I love green fly sandwiches!"

26
00:02:03.198 --> 00:02:05.282
Jeremy grinned.

27
00:02:05.283 --> 00:02:08.211
"I made lots of sandwiches this morning.

28
00:02:08.212 --> 00:02:12.445
We can have a picnic for two!"

29
00:02:12.446 --> 00:02:19.325
"Look!" Ribby said. "There's Mr. Dribber.

30
00:02:19.326 --> 00:02:22.048
Can he come to our picnic?"

31
00:02:22.049 --> 00:02:27.477
Jeremy sighed. "Okay," he said.

32
00:02:27.478 --> 00:02:40.021
"We will have a picnic for three!"
